# Files Mintlify must not build or serve.
#
# Syntax is .gitignore-style. Unlike omitting a page from docs.json
# navigation, which only hides it from the sidebar and leaves it live at
# its URL, entries here are excluded from the build entirely and cannot
# be reached by URL.
#
# https://www.mintlify.com/docs/organize/mintignore

# Internal partner (BYOW / sub-account) and admin documentation.
# These were publicly served at docs.totalis.trade/_internal/... until
# 2026-09-01 purely because nothing linked to them.
_internal/

# Contributor-facing files that are not product documentation.
STYLE.md
README.md
